  "hypothesis": "Parsing fragments once into compact numeric records and traversing the Cartesian product in small cache tiles should reduce repeated string work and keep fragment data local; integer wheel trial division provides a simple classifier without constructing temporary concatenation strings.",
  "notes": "This is an unmeasured locality and candidate-construction experiment; no speed or correctness result is claimed.",
